From 8e60a9b1c65110bcd4d4108d18c82375f7aa89fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:55:10 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Move Global Configuration from Settings to its own page

The Caddyfile editor, import check and backup/rollback now live at
/global-config, linked from the sidebar's Global config item. Removes
the Settings tab, its nav link, actions and template variables.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GFYvS9tgNsRjfuEB4vjX1t
